CUDA-graph replay of the whole layer stack per (token, sequence) bucket with static per-step index buffers, a fixed-tile
Triton GEMM for the GatedDeltaNet in_proj_b|a projection, the readout on a fixed row count, attention with num_splits=1,
pinned FLA kernel configurations, one packed [state | question] sequence per decision (prefix_bidir), and a step scheduler.

